  "content": {
    "id": "p24-q3-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "A sphere has a surface area of $500\\text{ cm}^2$. Find its radius, correct to four decimal places.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$6.3078\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}S&=4\\pi r^2\\\\500&=4\\pi r^2\\\\r^2&=\\frac{500}{4\\pi}\\\\r&=\\sqrt{\\frac{125}{\\pi}}\\\\r&\\approx6.3078\\text{ cm}\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe radius is positive. The answer is correct to four decimal places.",
